# TapTalk — Project Rules

**Repo:** https://github.com/CavenLink-Dev/TapTalk.v2  
**Stack:** React Native + Expo SDK 54 + Expo Router · TypeScript · iOS 16+ · iPhone first · EAS builds

## Machine Setup

Developer switches 50/50 between Windows and Mac. **GitHub is the only source of truth.**

- Never reference a local file as if it definitely exists on this machine
- Never assume anything from a previous session is present locally
- Never say "the file we created earlier" — it may not be on this machine yet
- If a file is needed and you are not sure it exists, **ask the user to check**
- Session start: user runs `git pull origin main`
- Session end: everything committed and pushed to GitHub

## GitHub Workflow

Every change gets **committed and pushed immediately after it works** — not at end of day. GitHub must always be up to date.

